Key takeaways
.pptm / .xlsx / .docx = ZIP. Always unzip first.
zsteg crashes on tall images → increase Ruby stack.
DNS tunneling = filter by destination IP, extract subdomains, base64.
BMP header: offset at 0x0A, DIB size at 0x0E, height at 0x16.
HTB RDP terminals eat pasted text. Type manually.
/etc/wpa_supplicant/functions.sh is 25KB of generic Ubuntu code. The actual config is in action_wpa.sh or ifupdown.sh.
